# status

- user needs info that templates and scripts have been moved into a single file
- FILE imports have been dropped
- FILE storage locations have been dropped
- users can add WebDAV storage or local home storage to regain what they did with
  FILE imports or storage
- FILE is still allowed for attachments or images - its the last version where
  that is possible
- users can try out new version and manually move files to VFS

